 "html": "<div><span><span><img alt src=\"/wiki-files/64/64e6f42e825ba175a4fb056b712a2c7385f9828a.jpg\" width=\"560\" height=\"201\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span>\n<div>\n<div>ArcheAge Classic Wiki</div>\n<div>Everything about the golden age of Erenor</div>\n<div><div role=\"button\"><span>Search for an item, skill, mount, recipe ...</span></div></div>\n<div><span><a href=\"/wiki/getting-started\">Start Your Journey</a></span><a href=\"https://wiki.aa-classic.com/Special:PopularPages\" rel=\"noopener\">Popular Pages</a></div>\n</div>\n<div><div><div><span><a href=\"/wiki/activity-tokens\">Weekly Tokens</a></span><span></span></div><div>Each day lasts from 00:00 to 23:59 server time (New York). The quests can be finished any time during the week.</div><div><div><div><span><span>Friday</span><span>Fri</span></span><span></span></div><ul><li title=\"The Crystalline Bloodbath - 30 Activity Tokens\"><span><a href=\"/wiki/crystalline-bloodbath\">The Crystalline Bloodbath</a></span><span><span><a href=\"/wiki/activity-tokens\"><img alt=\"Activity Tokens\" src=\"/wiki-files/12/1221de54ac2a0640c58446bd843cd8b34431e447.png\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><span>30</span></span></li></ul></div><div><div><span><span>Saturday</span><span>Sat</span></span><span></span></div><ul><li title=\"Preparing for the Fish Market - 20 Activity Tokens\"><span><a href=\"/wiki/fishing-quest\">Preparing for the Fish Market</a></span><span><span><a href=\"/wiki/activity-tokens\"><img alt=\"Activity Tokens\" src=\"/wiki-files/12/1221de54ac2a0640c58446bd843cd8b34431e447.png\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><span>20</span></span></li><li title=\"Have You Ever Seen A Ghost? - 33 Activity Tokens\"><span><a href=\"/wiki/delphinad-ghost-ship\">Have You Ever Seen A Ghost?</a></span><span><span><a href=\"/wiki/activity-tokens\"><img alt=\"Activity Tokens\" src=\"/wiki-files/12/1221de54ac2a0640c58446bd843cd8b34431e447.png\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><span>33</span></span></li><li title=\"Guardians of the Library - 10 Activity Tokens\"><span><a href=\"/wiki/ayanad-library\">Guardians of the Library</a></span><span><span><a href=\"/wiki/activity-tokens\"><img alt=\"Activity Tokens\" src=\"/wiki-files/12/1221de54ac2a0640c58446bd843cd8b34431e447.png\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><span>10</span></span></li><li title=\"Guardians of the Library 2 - 10 Activity Tokens\"><span><a href=\"/wiki/ayanad-library\">Guardians of the Library 2</a></span><span><span><a href=\"/wiki/activity-tokens\"><img alt=\"Activity Tokens\" src=\"/wiki-files/12/1221de54ac2a0640c58446bd843cd8b34431e447.png\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><span>10</span></span></li></ul><div><span>Total</span><span><span><a href=\"/wiki/activity-tokens\"><img alt=\"Activity Tokens\" src=\"/wiki-files/12/1221de54ac2a0640c58446bd843cd8b34431e447.png\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><span>73</span></span></div></div><div><div><span><span>Sunday</span><span>Sun</span></span><span></span></div><ul><li title=\"The Crimson Threat - 33 Activity Tokens\"><span><a href=\"/wiki/anthalon\">The Crimson Threat</a></span><span><span><a href=\"/wiki/activity-tokens\"><img alt=\"Activity Tokens\" src=\"/wiki-files/12/1221de54ac2a0640c58446bd843cd8b34431e447.png\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><span>33</span></span></li></ul><div>To unlock this quest, first finish the custom story quests (Chapter 99): kill the Hounds of Kyrios, then Anthalon.</div></div></div></div></div>\n</div>",
